  "instance_name": "pet_owner_relativity",
  "label": "Pet owner relatability",
  "description": "The meme plays on the common experience of pet owners who are frustrated or amused by their pets' behaviors, particularly when it comes to cleanliness. The humor is derived from the viewer's understanding of the absurdity of the situation — a cat 'washing' its paws in the toilet after using the litterbox — which is a relatable scenario for many pet owners. This relatability is not visible in the image but is essential to the meme's comedic effect.",
